description	"Captain Jack Sparrow

^2Weaponry:
- Rapier
-- ^5Cyan ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)
-- Ranged Deflect (2)
- Flintlock Pistol (3)

^8Attributes:
- Expert Swordsmanship [BP Free Jumps]
- Regenerating Shields 
- Heal (2)
- Rally

Captain Jack Sparrow has fought undead pirates, defeated Davy Jones, and been to the ends of the world and back, but he is about to face a threat like nothing he's ever seen before. He carries a flintlock pistol, a precursor to the modern hand pistol."